# ACCESSORIES — worn besides a hat (see SPEC.md, "Accessories"): one at a time, and
# together with any hat. Each has TWO frames:
#   acc_<name>       drawn exactly where the fox wears it on `sit` (front view)
#   acc_<name>_side  drawn exactly where it wears it on `run_1` (side view, facing left)
# The engine moves the art by the difference between a frame's wear anchor
# (art/pet/wear.txt; by default its hat anchor) and the anchor of `sit` (7 3) or
# `run_1` (6 3), mirrors the side art for the peeks, and clips it to the frame.
# Accessories are never recoloured by a look. The lenses leave the eye pixels
# open, so blinks and glances show through.

# Glasses: light metal frames, square, around each eye; the bridge and the temples
# on the upper eye row.
@frame acc_glasses
................
................
................
................
...ggg..ggg.....
..gg.gggg.gg....
...g.g..g.g.....
...ggg..ggg.....
................
................
................
................
................
................
................
................

@frame acc_glasses_side
